@startuml Runtime Diagram
title Runtime Diagram - Wiki guide + kreiranje, zavrsni kviz, recenzije i resavanje slucaja + profil korisnika + svijetla/tamna tema + menu sun/moon switch + korisnicka podrska + admin panel (zaseban admin nalog, tabovi, aktivna verzija i promjena lozinke) + admin popup obavjestenja

actor "Operater sistema" as Operator
actor "Korisnik" as User
participant "start.sh Launcher" as StartScript
participant "Run Mode Port Profile" as PortProfile
participant "Frontend Router" as Router
participant "Frontend Host Allowlist (Vite)" as FrontendHostAllow
participant "DesktopGate" as Gate
participant "LandingPage (/)" as Landing
participant "Theme Menu Toggle" as ThemeMenuToggle
participant "LoginPage" as Login
participant "App Route Guard" as Guard
participant "LoggedHomePage" as LoggedHome
participant "Admin Announcement Popup" as AnnouncementPopup
participant "CreateCasePage (/slucaj/novi)" as CreateCaseStart
participant "CaseWorkspacePage" as Workspace
participant "CreateCaseSidebar" as WorkspaceSidebar
participant "CaseTimelineTab" as TimelineTab
participant "CasePeopleTab" as PeopleTab
participant "CaseStatementsTab" as StatementsTab
participant "CasePoliceDocumentsTab" as DocsTab
participant "CaseInterrogationsTab" as InterrogationsTab
participant "CaseQuizTab" as QuizTab
participant "ProfilePage" as ProfilePage
participant "SupportPage" as SupportPage
participant "WikiPage (/wiki)" as WikiPage
participant "Cases API Client" as CasesClient
participant "Case Timeline API Client" as TimelineClient
participant "Case People API Client" as PeopleClient
participant "Case Documents API Client" as DocumentsClient
participant "Case Interrogations API Client" as InterrogationsClient
participant "Case Quiz API Client" as QuizClient
participant "Case Reviews API Client" as ReviewsClient
participant "Case Progress API Client" as ProgressClient
participant "Profile API Client" as ProfileClient
participant "Theme Storage Service" as ThemeStorage
participant "Support API Client" as SupportClient
participant "Announcements API Client" as AnnouncementsClient
participant "Auth API Client" as AuthClient
participant "Express Auth API" as AuthApi
participant "Express Cases API" as CasesApi
participant "Express Profile API" as ProfileApi
participant "Express Support API" as SupportApi
participant "Express Admin API" as AdminApi
participant "Express Announcements API" as AnnouncementsApi
participant "Auth Guard (JWT)" as JwtGuard
participant "Admin Panel Guard (JWT scope)" as AdminGuard
participant "Cases Service" as CasesService
participant "Case Timeline Service" as TimelineService
participant "Case People Service" as PeopleService
participant "Case Documents Service" as DocumentsService
participant "Case Interrogations Service" as InterrogationsService
participant "Case Quiz Service" as QuizService
participant "Case Reviews Service" as ReviewsService
participant "Case Progress Service" as ProgressService
participant "Case Publish Service" as PublishService
participant "Case Timeline Validation" as TimelineValidation
participant "Profile Service" as ProfileService
participant "Support Service" as SupportService
participant "Admin Service" as AdminService
participant "Admin Settings Service" as AdminSettingsService
participant "Announcements Service" as AnnouncementsService
participant "Admin Announcements Service" as AdminAnnouncementsService
participant "Case Solve Visibility Service" as SolveVisibility
participant "Case Solve Roles Service" as SolveRoles
participant "Cases Repository" as CasesRepo
participant "Case Timeline Repository" as TimelineRepo
participant "Case Progress Repository" as ProgressRepo
participant "Case People Repository" as PeopleRepo
participant "Case Documents Repository" as DocumentsRepo
participant "Case Interrogations Repository" as InterrogationsRepo
participant "Case Quiz Repository" as QuizRepo
participant "Case Reviews Repository" as ReviewsRepo
participant "Case Publish Repository" as PublishRepo
participant "Profile Repository" as ProfileRepo
participant "Support Repository" as SupportRepo
participant "Admin Repository" as AdminRepo
participant "User Repository" as UserRepo
participant "Admin Announcements Repository" as AdminAnnouncementsRepo
participant "App Settings Repository" as AppSettingsRepo
actor "Administrator" as Admin
participant "Admin Login View" as AdminLoginView
participant "Admin Host Allowlist (Vite)" as AdminHostAllow
participant "Admin Dashboard" as AdminDashboard
participant "Admin API Client" as AdminClient
database "SQLite users" as UsersStore
database "SQLite admin_accounts" as AdminAccountsStore
database "SQLite cases/timeline/progress" as CasesStore
database "SQLite people + dossiers + role assignments" as PeopleStore
database "SQLite case_documents(metadata_json)" as DocumentsStore
database "SQLite case_interrogations + nodes" as InterrogationsStore
database "SQLite case_quiz_questions/options/results" as QuizStore
database "SQLite support_tickets" as SupportStore
database "SQLite admin_announcements + dismissals" as AdminAnnouncementsStore
database "SQLite app_settings" as AppSettingsStore
database "LocalStorage (session)" as SessionStore
database "LocalStorage (theme preference)" as ThemeStore
database "LocalStorage (admin session)" as AdminSessionStore
participant "Desktop Notice View" as Notice

Operator -> StartScript: Pokrece ./start.sh [production|debug]
StartScript -> PortProfile: Resolve run moda i portova
PortProfile --> StartScript: production (3001/5173/5174)\ndebug (3002/5175/5176)
StartScript -> AuthApi: Start backend server na izabranom backend portu
StartScript -> Router: Start korisnicki frontend na izabranom frontend portu
StartScript -> AdminLoginView: Start admin frontend na izabranom admin portu
StartScript -> AuthApi: FRONTEND_ORIGINS = user/admin URL iz aktivnog moda
StartScript -> Router: VITE_API_PROXY_TARGET = backend URL iz aktivnog moda
StartScript -> AdminLoginView: VITE_API_PROXY_TARGET = backend URL iz aktivnog moda
StartScript -> Router: Inherit opcioni VITE_ALLOWED_HOSTS override
StartScript -> AdminLoginView: Inherit opcioni VITE_ALLOWED_HOSTS override

alt Desktop sirina
  User -> FrontendHostAllow: Otvara / sa Host header-om
  FrontendHostAllow -> Router: Host validiran kroz allowedHosts
  User -> Router: Nastavlja ucitavanje /
  Router -> SessionStore: Citanje aktivne sesije korisnika (ako postoji)
  Router -> ThemeStorage: initializeThemePreference()
  ThemeStorage -> ThemeStore: localStorage.getItem(theme_key:{userScope})
  ThemeStore --> ThemeStorage: "light" | "dark" | null (scope korisnika)
  ThemeStorage --> Router: Primena root data-theme atributa
  Router -> Gate: Provera desktop pravila
  Gate -> Landing: Render marketinske javne pocetne
  User -> Landing: Pregled benefita igre i CTA sekcija
  User -> Landing: Klik sun/moon switch u lijevom meniju
  Landing -> ThemeMenuToggle: handleThemeToggle()
  ThemeMenuToggle -> SessionStore: Citanje korisnika za theme scope
  ThemeMenuToggle -> ThemeStorage: setStoredThemePreference(theme, scope)
  ThemeStorage -> ThemeStore: localStorage.setItem(theme_key:{scope}, theme)
  ThemeMenuToggle -> ThemeStorage: applyThemePreference(theme)
  ThemeStorage --> ThemeMenuToggle: Potvrda aktivne teme
  Landing -> Router: Navigacija na /registracija ili /prijava
  Router -> Gate: Provera desktop pravila
  Gate -> Login: Render prijavne forme

  User -> Router: Otvara /wiki
  Router -> Gate: Provera desktop pravila
  Gate -> WikiPage: Render wiki stranice
  User -> WikiPage: Pregled obrasca koriscenja i ruta
  WikiPage -> Router: Navigacija na /prijava
  Router -> Gate: Provera desktop pravila
  Gate -> Login: Render prijavne forme
  User -> Login: Unos kredencijala i submit
  Login -> AuthClient: POST /api/auth/login
  AuthClient -> AuthApi: HTTP zahtev
  AuthApi --> AuthClient: JWT token + user payload
  AuthClient -> SessionStore: Upis tokena i korisnika

  Login -> Router: Navigacija na /app
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> LoggedHome: Render ulogovane pocetne

  LoggedHome -> AnnouncementsClient: GET /api/announcements/pending
  AnnouncementsClient -> AnnouncementsApi: HTTP zahtev
  AnnouncementsApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> AnnouncementsService: getPendingAnnouncements(userId)
  AnnouncementsService -> AdminAnnouncementsRepo: getPendingAdminAnnouncementsForUser(userId)
  AdminAnnouncementsRepo -> UsersStore: SELECT users(created_at) za userId
  AdminAnnouncementsRepo -> AdminAnnouncementsStore: SELECT nedismissovana obavjestenja za korisnika
  UsersStore --> AdminAnnouncementsRepo: created_at korisnika
  AdminAnnouncementsStore --> AdminAnnouncementsRepo: lista obavjestenja
  AdminAnnouncementsRepo --> AnnouncementsService: pending obavjestenja
  AnnouncementsService --> AnnouncementsApi: response payload
  AnnouncementsApi --> AnnouncementsClient: JSON uspeh
  AnnouncementsClient --> AnnouncementPopup: Prikaz popup obavjestenja

  LoggedHome -> CasesClient: GET /api/cases/home
  CasesClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> CasesService: getLoggedHomeOverview(userId)
  CasesService -> CasesRepo: getHomeOverviewRows(userId)
  CasesRepo -> CasesStore: SELECT sekcije + statistika
  CasesStore --> CasesRepo: podaci
  CasesRepo --> CasesService: agregat
  CasesService --> CasesApi: response payload
  CasesApi --> CasesClient: JSON uspeh
  CasesClient --> LoggedHome: Prikaz kartica slucajeva

  User -> LoggedHome: Klik "Pokreni resavanje" na javnom slucaju
  LoggedHome -> Router: /slucaj/{caseId}/resavanje/vremenska-linija
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> Workspace: Otvaranje solve moda za izabrani javni slucaj

  User -> LoggedHome: Klik "Otvori statistiku" na objavljenom kreiranom slucaju
  LoggedHome -> ReviewsClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/reviews?scope=create
  ReviewsClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> ReviewsService: getCaseReviews(caseId, userId, "create")
  ReviewsService -> CasesRepo: findCaseByIdForAuthor(caseId, userId)
  ReviewsService -> ReviewsRepo: getCaseReviewSummary(caseId)
  ReviewsService -> ReviewsRepo: getResolvedCaseUsersByCaseId(caseId)
  ReviewsService -> ReviewsRepo: getCaseReviewsByCaseId(caseId)
  ReviewsRepo -> CasesStore: SELECT progress/rating/komentari + korisnici
  CasesStore --> ReviewsRepo: agregat + liste
  ReviewsRepo --> ReviewsService: summary + solvedUsers + reviews
  ReviewsService --> CasesApi: response payload
  CasesApi --> ReviewsClient: JSON uspeh
  ReviewsClient --> LoggedHome: Otvaranje popup panela statistike slucaja

  User -> LoggedHome: Klik "Kreiraj novi slucaj"
  LoggedHome -> Router: /slucaj/novi
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> CreateCaseStart: Forma naziv + opis

  User -> CreateCaseStart: Klik "Kreiraj slucaj"
  CreateCaseStart -> CasesClient: POST /api/cases
  CasesClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> CasesService: createCase(payload, userId)
  CasesService -> CasesRepo: createCaseWithDetails(...)
  CasesRepo -> CasesStore: INSERT case + inicijalni podaci
  CasesStore --> CasesRepo: novi caseId
  CasesRepo --> CasesService: case row
  CasesService --> CasesApi: 201 response
  CasesApi --> CasesClient: id slucaja

  CreateCaseStart -> Router: /slucaj/{caseId}/kreiranje/vremenska-linija
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> Workspace: Ucitavanje case workspace-a
  Workspace -> CasesClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/overview?scope=create
  CasesClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> CasesService: getCaseWorkspaceOverview(caseId, userId, "create")
  CasesService -> CasesRepo: findCaseByIdForAuthor(caseId, userId)
  CasesService -> QuizRepo: getCaseQuizQuestionCount(caseId)
  CasesRepo -> CasesStore: SELECT slucaj po id + author
  QuizRepo -> QuizStore: SELECT broj kviz pitanja
  CasesStore --> CasesRepo: case row
  QuizStore --> QuizRepo: broj pitanja
  CasesRepo --> CasesService: case row
  CasesService --> CasesApi: response payload
  CasesApi --> CasesClient: JSON uspeh
  CasesClient --> Workspace: Osnovni podaci slucaja + kviz statistika

  User -> WorkspaceSidebar: Klik "Objavi slucaj"
  WorkspaceSidebar -> CasesClient: POST /api/cases/{caseId}/publish
  CasesClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> PublishService: publishCreatorCase(caseId, authorUserId)
  PublishService -> CasesRepo: findCaseByIdForAuthor(caseId, authorUserId)

  alt Slucaj je vec objavljen
    PublishService --> CasesApi: response payload (alreadyPublished=true)
    CasesApi --> CasesClient: JSON uspeh
    CasesClient --> WorkspaceSidebar: Status poruka "Slucaj je vec objavljen."
  else Slucaj jos nije objavljen
    PublishService -> PublishRepo: getCasePublishReadinessSnapshot(caseId)
    PublishRepo -> PeopleStore: SELECT broj osoba + broj zrtava + broj osumnjicenih + timeline pokrivenost osoba
    PublishRepo -> DocumentsStore: SELECT broj dokumenata + timeline pokrivenost dokumenata
    PublishRepo -> QuizStore: SELECT broj kviz pitanja
    PublishRepo -> CasesStore: SELECT broj timeline stavki

    alt Publish uslovi nisu ispunjeni
      PublishService --> CasesApi: 400 response sa blockerima
      CasesApi --> CasesClient: JSON greska
      CasesClient --> WorkspaceSidebar: Prikaz poruke o neuslovima za objavu (zrtva/osumnjiceni/dokument/kviz/timeline)
    else Publish uslovi su ispunjeni
      PublishService -> PublishRepo: updateCasePublicationStatus(caseId, "published")
      PublishRepo -> CasesStore: UPDATE cases(publication_status='published')
      CasesStore --> PublishRepo: potvrda promjene statusa
      PublishService --> CasesApi: response payload (alreadyPublished=false)
      CasesApi --> CasesClient: JSON uspeh
      CasesClient --> WorkspaceSidebar: Potvrda uspesne objave
    end
  end

  User -> WorkspaceSidebar: Klik "Vrati slucaj u resavanje"
  WorkspaceSidebar -> ProgressClient: POST /api/cases/{caseId}/progress/reset-to-solve
  ProgressClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> ProgressService: resetCreatorCaseProgressToSolve(caseId, authorUserId)
  ProgressService -> CasesRepo: findCaseByIdForAuthor(caseId, authorUserId)
  ProgressService -> ProgressRepo: resetCaseUserProgressToSolve(caseId, authorUserId)
  ProgressRepo -> CasesStore: UPDATE case_user_progress (progress_status=in_progress, resolved_at=NULL)
  CasesStore --> ProgressRepo: potvrda reseta statusa
  ProgressRepo --> ProgressService: azuriran progress autora
  ProgressService --> CasesApi: response payload
  CasesApi --> ProgressClient: JSON uspeh
  ProgressClient --> WorkspaceSidebar: Status poruka o vracanju u rezim resavanja

  User -> WorkspaceSidebar: Klik tab "Vremenska linija"
  WorkspaceSidebar -> Router: /slucaj/{caseId}/kreiranje/vremenska-linija
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> Workspace: Render taba vremenska linija
  Workspace -> TimelineTab: Prosledjuje caseId i mode
  TimelineTab -> TimelineClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/timeline
  TimelineClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> TimelineService: getCreatorCaseTimeline(caseId, userId)
  TimelineService -> CasesRepo: findCaseById(caseId) + provera pristupa
  TimelineService -> CasesStore: ensure case_user_progress za korisnika
  TimelineService -> TimelineRepo: getCaseTimelineItemsByCaseId(caseId)
  TimelineRepo -> CasesStore: SELECT case_timeline_items (redosled + napomene + datum/vreme)
  TimelineRepo -> PeopleStore: SELECT direktorijum osoba za timeline
  TimelineRepo -> DocumentsStore: SELECT direktorijum dokumenata za timeline
  CasesStore --> TimelineRepo: timeline stavke
  PeopleStore --> TimelineRepo: osobe
  DocumentsStore --> TimelineRepo: dokumenti
  TimelineRepo --> TimelineService: timeline payload
  TimelineService --> CasesApi: response payload
  CasesApi --> TimelineClient: JSON uspeh
  TimelineClient --> TimelineTab: Prikaz roadmap-a i dostupnih izvora
  TimelineTab -> TimelineTab: Liste za dodavanje filtriraju vec dodate osobe i dokumente

  User -> TimelineTab: Dodaje stavke i menja redosled otkljucavanja
  TimelineTab -> TimelineClient: PUT /api/cases/{caseId}/timeline
  TimelineClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> TimelineService: replaceCreatorCaseTimeline(caseId, payload, userId)
  TimelineService -> TimelineValidation: validateReplaceCaseTimelinePayload(payload, availableSources)
  TimelineValidation --> TimelineService: Validacija (ista osoba i isti dokument ne mogu biti dodati vise od jednom)
  TimelineService -> TimelineRepo: DELETE postojecih + INSERT novih timeline stavki
  TimelineRepo -> CasesStore: WRITE case_timeline_items
  CasesStore --> TimelineRepo: potvrda upisa
  TimelineRepo --> TimelineService: azurirana lista stavki
  TimelineService --> CasesApi: 200 response
  CasesApi --> TimelineClient: JSON uspeh
  TimelineClient --> TimelineTab: Osvjezenje i potvrda cuvanja

  User -> WorkspaceSidebar: Klik tab "Osobe i dosijei"
  WorkspaceSidebar -> Router: /slucaj/{caseId}/kreiranje/osobe-i-dosijei
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> Workspace: Render taba osobe i dosijei
  Workspace -> PeopleTab: Prosledjuje caseId i mode
  PeopleTab -> PeopleClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/people
  PeopleClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> PeopleService: getCreatorCasePeople(caseId, userId)
  PeopleService -> CasesRepo: findCaseByIdForAuthor(caseId, userId)
  PeopleService -> PeopleRepo: getCasePeopleByCaseId(caseId)
  PeopleRepo -> PeopleStore: SELECT osobe + dosijei
  PeopleStore --> PeopleRepo: lista osoba
  PeopleRepo --> PeopleService: mapirani podaci
  PeopleService --> CasesApi: response payload
  CasesApi --> PeopleClient: JSON uspeh
  PeopleClient --> PeopleTab: Prikaz liste osoba

  PeopleTab -> DocumentsClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/statements + /police-documents
  DocumentsClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtevi za povezane dokumente osobe
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> DocumentsService: Ucitavanje izjava i policijskih dokumenata
  DocumentsService -> DocumentsRepo: SELECT case_documents + metadata_json
  DocumentsRepo -> DocumentsStore: Citanje dokumenata slucaja
  DocumentsStore --> DocumentsRepo: dokumenta za mapiranje veza po osobi
  DocumentsRepo --> DocumentsService: mapirani dokumenti
  DocumentsService --> CasesApi: response payload
  CasesApi --> DocumentsClient: JSON uspeh
  DocumentsClient --> PeopleTab: Mapa povezanih dokumenata po osobi

  User -> PeopleTab: Kreira novu osobu/dosije
  PeopleTab -> PeopleClient: POST /api/cases/{caseId}/people
  PeopleClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> PeopleService: createCreatorCasePerson(caseId, payload, userId)
  PeopleService -> PeopleService: Validacija (obavezna uloga + obavezna polja dosijea)
  PeopleService -> PeopleRepo: INSERT osoba + dosije + profil
  PeopleRepo -> PeopleStore: INSERT case_people + dossier tabele
  PeopleStore --> PeopleRepo: personId/dossierId
  PeopleRepo --> PeopleService: kreirana osoba
  PeopleService --> CasesApi: 201 response
  CasesApi --> PeopleClient: JSON uspeh
  PeopleClient --> PeopleTab: Osvjezenje liste + pregled dosijea

  User -> PeopleTab: U formalnom dosijeu klik "Izmeni dosije"
  PeopleTab -> PeopleClient: PUT /api/cases/{caseId}/people/{personId}
  PeopleClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> PeopleService: updateCreatorCasePerson(caseId, personId, payload, userId)
  PeopleService -> PeopleService: Validacija (obavezna uloga + obavezna polja dosijea)
  PeopleService -> PeopleRepo: UPDATE case_people + dossiers + dossier_profiles(revision++)
  PeopleRepo -> PeopleStore: UPDATE osoba i dosije podataka
  PeopleStore --> PeopleRepo: potvrda azuriranja
  PeopleRepo --> PeopleService: azurirana osoba
  PeopleService --> CasesApi: 200 response
  CasesApi --> PeopleClient: JSON uspeh
  PeopleClient --> PeopleTab: Osvjezenje liste + azuriran formalni dosije

  User -> PeopleTab: U dosijeu klik na povezanu izjavu/dokument
  PeopleTab -> Router: /slucaj/{caseId}/kreiranje/(izjave|dokumenti)?documentId={id}
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> Workspace: Otvara trazeni tab dokumentacije
  Workspace -> StatementsTab: ili DocsTab ucitava listu
  StatementsTab -> DocumentsClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/statements (ako je izjava)
  DocsTab -> DocumentsClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/police-documents (ako je dokument)
  DocumentsClient --> Workspace: Ucitanje + auto-otvaranje preview modala po documentId

  User -> PeopleTab: U dosijeu klik "Saslusaj osobu"
  PeopleTab -> Router: /slucaj/{caseId}/resavanje/saslusanja?interrogationPersonId={personId}
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> Workspace: Otvara tab saslusanja u rezimu pregleda
  Workspace -> InterrogationsTab: Prosledjuje caseId i mode
  InterrogationsTab -> InterrogationsClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/interrogations
  InterrogationsClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> InterrogationsService: getCreatorCaseInterrogations(caseId, userId)
  InterrogationsService -> CasesRepo: Provera autorstva slucaja
  InterrogationsService -> InterrogationsRepo: SELECT saslusanja + cvorovi
  InterrogationsRepo -> InterrogationsStore: SELECT case_interrogations + case_interrogation_nodes
  InterrogationsStore --> InterrogationsRepo: lista saslusanja i stabla
  InterrogationsService -> DocumentsRepo: getCasePeopleDirectoryByCaseId(caseId)
  DocumentsRepo -> PeopleStore: SELECT osobe + status zivosti
  PeopleStore --> DocumentsRepo: direktorijum osoba
  InterrogationsRepo --> InterrogationsService: mapirana saslusanja
  InterrogationsService --> CasesApi: response payload
  CasesApi --> InterrogationsClient: JSON uspeh
  InterrogationsClient --> InterrogationsTab: Auto-otvaranje chat modala po personId

  User -> StatementsTab: U formalnom prikazu klik na povezanu osobu
  StatementsTab -> Router: /slucaj/{caseId}/kreiranje/osobe-i-dosijei?personId={id}
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> Workspace: Otvara tab osobe i dosijei
  Workspace -> PeopleTab: Ucitava osobe i otvara dosije po personId

  User -> WorkspaceSidebar: Klik tab "Izjave"
  WorkspaceSidebar -> Router: /slucaj/{caseId}/kreiranje/izjave
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> Workspace: Render taba izjave
  Workspace -> StatementsTab: Prosledjuje caseId i mode
  StatementsTab -> DocumentsClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/statements
  DocumentsClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> DocumentsService: getCreatorCaseStatements(caseId, userId)
  DocumentsService -> CasesRepo: Provera autorstva slucaja
  DocumentsService -> DocumentsRepo: getCaseDocumentsByCaseIdAndTypes(caseId, statementTypes)
  DocumentsRepo -> DocumentsStore: SELECT izjave + metadata_json
  DocumentsStore --> DocumentsRepo: lista izjava
  DocumentsRepo --> DocumentsService: mapirani dokumenti + direktorijum osoba
  DocumentsService --> CasesApi: response payload
  CasesApi --> DocumentsClient: JSON uspeh
  DocumentsClient --> StatementsTab: Lista izjava + osobe

  User -> StatementsTab: Popunjava i cuva novu izjavu (sa tip-specificnim poljima)
  StatementsTab -> DocumentsClient: POST /api/cases/{caseId}/statements
  DocumentsClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> DocumentsService: createCreatorCaseStatement(caseId, payload, userId)
  DocumentsService -> CasesRepo: Provera autorstva slucaja
  DocumentsService -> DocumentsRepo: getCasePeopleDirectoryByCaseId(caseId)
  DocumentsRepo -> PeopleStore: SELECT osobe u slucaju
  PeopleStore --> DocumentsRepo: ljudi za validaciju
  DocumentsService -> DocumentsRepo: createCaseDocumentForCase(caseId, payload + metadata.typeSpecific)
  DocumentsRepo -> DocumentsStore: INSERT case_documents (tip izjave + metadata_json)
  DocumentsStore --> DocumentsRepo: documentId
  DocumentsRepo --> DocumentsService: kreirana izjava
  DocumentsService --> CasesApi: 201 response
  CasesApi --> DocumentsClient: JSON uspeh
  DocumentsClient --> StatementsTab: Osvjezenje liste + formalni preview izjave

  User -> StatementsTab: U formalnom prikazu klik "Izmeni dokument"
  StatementsTab -> DocumentsClient: PUT /api/cases/{caseId}/statements/{documentId}
  DocumentsClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
  JwtGuard -> DocumentsService: updateCreatorCaseStatement(caseId, documentId, payload, userId)
  DocumentsService -> DocumentsRepo: UPDATE case_documents (statement metadata_json)
  DocumentsRepo -> DocumentsStore: UPDATE izjava
  DocumentsStore --> DocumentsRepo: potvrda azuriranja
  DocumentsRepo --> DocumentsService: azurirana izjava
  DocumentsService --> CasesApi: 200 response
  CasesApi --> DocumentsClient: JSON uspeh
  DocumentsClient --> StatementsTab: Osvjezenje liste + azuriran formalni preview

  User -> WorkspaceSidebar: Klik tab "Dokumenti"
  WorkspaceSidebar -> Router: /slucaj/{caseId}/kreiranje/dokumenti
  Router -> Guard: Provera sesije
  Guard -> Workspace: Render taba dokumenti
  Workspace -> DocsTab: Prosledjuje caseId i mode
  DocsTab -> DocumentsClient: GET /api/cases/{caseId}/police-documents
  DocumentsClient -> CasesApi: HTTP zahtev
  CasesApi -> JwtGuard: Verifikacija tokena
